App login karne se pehle Token Area mein jayein. Wahan diye gaye QR code ko scan karke APK download karein aur us APK ko apne device mein install karein.

Installation complete hone ke baad new APK se naya token generate karein aur uske baad sirf isi naye token ko use karein.

Gadar News ke liye bhi isi process ko follow karein — pehle new APK install karein, phir usi new APK se token banayein aur wahi token use karei